    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-neutral-200 p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-8">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
          Welcome to Nestly ("we", "our", "the Platform"). By creating an account or using
          our services, you agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not
          agree with any part of these terms, please do not use the Platform.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2">2. Definitions</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-600 space-y-1 leading-relaxed">
          <li><strong>Guest:</strong> a user who books a listing through the Platform.</li>
          <li><strong>Host:</strong> a user who lists a property or service on the Platform.</li>
          <li><strong>Listing:</strong> any property, room, or service made available for booking.</li>
          <li><strong>Booking:</strong> a confirmed reservation made between a Guest and a Host.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2">3. Account Registration</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
          You must be at least 18 years old to create an account. You agree to provide
          accurate, current, and complete information during registration and to keep your
          login credentials confidential. You are responsible for all activity that occurs
          under your account.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2">4. Host Responsibilities</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
          Hosts are responsible for ensuring that listings are accurately described, comply
          with local laws and housing regulations, and are safe for occupancy. Nestly does
          not own, manage, or control any listed property and is not a party to any rental
          agreement between Hosts and Guests.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2">5. Guest Responsibilities</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
          Guests agree to treat listed properties with care, follow any house rules set by
          the Host, and pay all applicable fees at the time of booking. Damages caused during
          a stay may be billed separately through the Platform.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2">6. Payments &amp; Fees</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
          All payments are processed through our third-party payment provider. Nestly charges
          a service fee of 8% to Guests and 3% to Hosts on each completed booking. Fees are
          disclosed before a booking is confirmed and are non-negotiable.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2">7. Cancellations &amp; Refunds</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
          Cancellation policies are set individually by each Host and displayed on the listing
          page prior to booking. Refunds, where applicable, are issued to the original payment
          method within 5–10 business days of a cancellation being approved.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2">8. Prohibited Conduct</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-neutral-600 space-y-1 leading-relaxed">
          <li>Posting false, misleading, or fraudulent listings</li>
          <li>Harassing, threatening, or discriminating against other users</li>
          <li>Circumventing the Platform to avoid service fees</li>
